{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":134924,\"title\":\"Cat's Tea\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"After a severe scolding from her mother, 15-year-old high school student Jasmine rushes to class in hopes of making it on time. But when a strange storm suddenly hits, lightning strikes down on Jasmine and renders her unconscious. Instead of waking up in the hospital, the girl opens her eyes to a cute, dog-eared boy named Longjing. What's more, Jasmine realizes she now possesses a pair of fluffy cat ears!\\n\\nFiguring she simply has a case of amnesia, Longjing offers to help guide Jasmine around the Tea Continent. Little does he know, she is more than excited to explore this RPG-styled world and fulfill her apparent destiny as the main character.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hkGyAWuCGEoWmlkFtnmxPwOxjJm.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4KcbRgbmkZOXVKer5v8wGniWCO5.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2021,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":3,\"totalEpisodes\":35,\"createdBy\":[\"糖人家\"],\"networks\":[\"bilibili\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CN\",\"name\":\"China\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2023-12-08\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":5115108,\"name\":\"Baizai Xiaoye\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"Tx4FFpfbLYI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"r5g6uVrSUIg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"GoT9-nc-nXk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":94693,\"title\":\"Wandering Witch: The Journey of Elaina\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gR0qwFa17c6xHnIauHrpgRJKiaH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42272727272727273,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":94631,\"title\":\"Diary of Our